{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/天生剑意","pageid":5476,"revid":12778,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%A4%A9%E7%94%9F%E5%89%91%E6%84%8F&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%A4%A9%E7%94%9F%E5%89%91%E6%84%8F&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%A4%A9%E7%94%9F%E5%89%91%E6%84%8F&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>天生剑意</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.A4.A9.E7.94.9F.E5.89.91.E6.84.8F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"天生剑意\"><b>天生剑意</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"技能 天生剑意.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f3/abnccg7ge0ac4kq14138gxh5exivrcx.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%A4%A9%E7%94%9F%E5%89%91%E6%84%8F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f3/abnccg7ge0ac4kq14138gxh5exivrcx.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%A4%A9%E7%94%9F%E5%89%91%E6%84%8F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f3/abnccg7ge0ac4kq14138gxh5exivrcx.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />天生剑意\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[反应]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（反应）被主动单体攻击前，进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"先制\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">先制</font></span></span>]，可造成<font color=\"#d68fe2\">100%</font>物攻值的魔法伤害，每回合最多可触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。被击败时，若自身拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>层及以上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自由意志\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">自由意志</font></span></span>]，则消耗6层，触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"强力不屈\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">强力不屈</font></span></span>]并获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免伤9\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免伤9</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合，每场战斗最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8D%97%E5%A8%9C%C2%B7%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91\" title=\"角色图鉴库/伊南娜·铃兰之剑\"><img alt=\"头像 伊南娜·铃兰之剑.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/95/7xf56pp71w2r9qrvn7pxbqra09q6el9.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">伊南娜·铃兰之剑</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022152506\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.428 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.599 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 9586/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 156906/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11616/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  576.618      1 模板:简单技能\n100.00%  576.618      1 -total\n  9.01%   51.981      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n  8.25%   47.548      4 模板:中括号介绍\n  2.48%   14.285      1 模板:面包屑\n  0.84%    4.821      1 模板:列表/头像\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:5476-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022152505 and revision id 12778. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"技能","missing":true}